    "body": "We must have missed a memo. 😉  \r\n\r\nThis can easily be changed (PRs welcome?); ultimately this is populating a [cookie-attribute-list](https://httpwg.org/http-extensions/draft-ietf-httpbis-rfc6265bis.html#section-5.6) which is a list of attributes, each one with an attribute-name and attribute-value. We approximate that with a list of lists, list of tuples, ordered map of key/value, define new concept types, etc. I don't have a strong preference.",
